 "_boss_items": "Boss loot (design/gdd/boss-loot.md, Boss 2026-11-16): boss_<boss>_<slot> = that boss's accessory set (necklace, earring, bracelet, ring, back), 2D icons only (never on the 3D model), no_drop = never a normal monster/chest/shop-tier drop (logic/boss_loot.gd gives them). relics = socket gems (a stack material in camp.json, never worn alone); effects count while the socketed item is worn and not broken (durability 0). Not built by tools/items/build_race_gear.py (it keeps non-race keys). Boss unique WEAPONS (Boss 2026-11-21): boss_mummy_boss_crook (the Pharaoh mini boss's golden crook, a greatsword) and boss_mummy_high_wizard_staff (the High Wizard's staff, magic): no set (they never count toward a boss set and are never in the boss shop), boss=pyramid, no_drop, req_level 20; given only by data/loot/boss_loot.json weapon_drops. Boss-unique tier: their main stat uses data/items/tier_up.json level_stat_mul \"20\" (only these two pieces are level 20). Models: art/weapons/race_boss/ (built by tools/items/build_boss_weapons.py on the Studio rig)."
